      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠩᠺᠠᠺᠠᠳᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>tengkekedekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тэнхээдэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TENGKEGEDE-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. To be or feel exhausted, lose strength.</definition>
      <page>803</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠷᠡ ᠲᠡᠭᠦᠨ ᠢ ᠳᠠᠭᠠᠭᠠᠬᠤ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠶᠡᠺᠡᠯ᠎ᠡ ᠲᠠᠩᠺᠠᠺᠠᠳᠠᠺᠥᠵᠦ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>tere tegyn i daγaγaxu ygei jekel-e --zy baimui</transcript>
          <definition> Unable to endure it, he is greatly exhausted</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
